{"ID": 1333520093790998528, "Timestamp": "2025-01-27 19:32:45", "Contents": "To decrypt \n\"steghide extract -sf <cover_file> -p <passphrase>\"", "Attachments": ""},
{"ID": 1333519965571256400, "Timestamp": "2025-01-27 19:32:15", "Contents": "To encrypt data using Steghide, use the command: \n\"steghide embed -cf <cover_file> -ef <embed_file> -p <passphrase>\"\n; where \"-cf\" specifies the cover file (image where data will be hidden), \"-ef\" specifies the file to embed (data to be encrypted), and \"-p\" sets the passphrase for encryption", "Attachments": ""},
